---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";

const lastUpdated = "21 May 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${site.name} collects, uses and protects your data. Cookies, analytics, advertising, contact-form submissions and your rights.`}
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="hero-blob"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-20 pb-8 sm:pt-24">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-600">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>{site.name}</strong> ("we", "us", "our") collects,
        uses, shares and protects your personal information when you visit <a href={site.url} class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">{site.domain}</a>
        or interact with our marketing site. It does <strong>not</strong> cover our SaaS products
        like TravelERP, which have their own product-level privacy terms shown at signup.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-2 tracking-tight">1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        {site.name} is an independent software studio based in India. You can reach us at
        <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`} class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">{site.contactEmail}</a>
        or on the number listed on our <a href="/contact" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">contact page</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-2 tracking-tight">2. What we collect</h2>
      <p>We collect two kinds of information from this website:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>
          <strong>Information you give us actively.</strong> When you submit the contact form, we
          collect your name, email address, mobile number, company name (if provided), the topic
          you selected, and the message text. If you contact us via email, phone or WhatsApp we
          will also have whatever details you share in that conversation.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> Like most websites, when you visit
          we automatically receive standard log data — your IP address (typically anonymised by
          our analytics provider), browser type, device type, pages viewed, time on page, referring
          URL, and approximate location derived from IP. We do not collect precise GPS location.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-2 tracking-tight">3. How we use your information</h2>
      <p>We use the information we collect for the following purposes:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>To respond to enquiries and provide the services or information you requested.</li>
        <li>To improve our website, content and services based on aggregate usage patterns.</li>
        <li>To send relevant follow-up communications about your enquiry (we do not add you to any marketing list without consent).</li>
        <li>To detect and prevent abuse, spam and security incidents.</li>
        <li>To comply with our legal and tax obligations under Indian law.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-2 tracking-tight">4. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
      <p>
        We and our third-party service providers use cookies and similar tracking technologies
        (pixels, local storage) to make the site work, measure how it is used and serve relevant
        advertising. The main categories are:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>
          <strong>Strictly necessary cookies.</strong> Required for the site to function — for example
          remembering that you have accepted our cookie banner.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Analytics cookies.</strong> Set by Google Analytics 4 to help us understand how visitors
          use the site (which pages get traffic, where they come from, how long they stay). The data
          is aggregated and does not identify you personally.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Advertising cookies.</strong> Set by Google AdSense and its advertising partners to
          show you relevant ads on this and other sites and to measure ad performance. These cookies
          can include personalised advertising identifiers.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You can control or disable cookies in your browser settings at any time. You can also opt
        out of personalised Google advertising at
        <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">adssettings.google.com</a>.
        Disabling cookies will not break the site, but some features (analytics, ad relevance)
        will not work for you.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-2 tracking-tight">5. Third-party services we use</h2>
      <p>This site relies on a small number of third-party services. Each has its own privacy policy that also applies to you when you use this site:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>
          <strong>Cloudflare</strong> — hosting, DNS, CDN and edge compute. They see your IP address
          and request metadata for security and performance reasons.
          <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> — anonymised traffic analytics.
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">Google Privacy Policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google AdSense</strong> — advertising delivery and measurement.
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">How Google uses your data</a>.
          Third-party vendors and ad networks served by Google may use cookies to serve ads based on
          your prior visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalised advertising
          via <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">Google Ads Settings</a>
          or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">aboutads.info</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Zoho Mail</strong> — we send transactional email (contact-form responses) via Zoho
          using our own SMTP credentials. Your message body and contact details pass through Zoho's
          mail servers.
          <a href="https://www.zoho.com/privacy.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">Zoho Privacy Policy</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Fonts</strong> — the Inter typeface is loaded from Google Fonts. Google may
          log IP addresses of font requests.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-2 tracking-tight">6. How we share your information</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell your personal information. We share it only in these limited cases:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>With the third-party service providers listed in section 5, strictly to operate this site.</li>
        <li>With our internal team members who need access to respond to your enquiry.</li>
        <li>When required by law, court order, or to enforce our legal rights.</li>
        <li>If we ever sell or transfer our business, with the acquiring entity (subject to this Privacy Policy).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-2 tracking-tight">7. How long we keep your data</h2>
      <p>
        We retain contact-form submissions and email correspondence for as long as we have an
        active commercial relationship with you, plus the period required by Indian tax and
        accounting law (typically 7 years). Analytics data is retained per Google Analytics'
        default settings (up to 14 months for event-level data). You can request earlier deletion —
        see section 9.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-2 tracking-tight">8. Security</h2>
      <p>
        We use industry-standard security measures including HTTPS encryption for all site traffic,
        Cloudflare's edge protection against common attacks, encrypted secrets for our SMTP and
        third-party credentials, and access controls on our internal tools. No system is perfectly
        secure; please use a unique password if you create an account on any of our products, and
        let us know immediately if you suspect a security issue.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-2 tracking-tight">9. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Subject to applicable law, you have the right to:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Ask us what personal data we hold about you.</li>
        <li>Ask us to correct inaccurate data.</li>
        <li>Ask us to delete data we no longer need.</li>
        <li>Ask us to stop sending you communications.</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent you previously gave (where consent is the legal basis).</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To exercise any of these rights, write to <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`} class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">{site.contactEmail}</a>.
        We will respond within 30 days. If you are in a jurisdiction with stronger data-protection
        rights (such as the EU, UK or California), those rights also apply to your data and we will
        comply with the higher standard.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-2 tracking-tight">10. Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This site is not directed at children under 13 (or under 16 in the EU). We do not knowingly
        collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with
        personal information, please contact us and we will delete it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-2 tracking-tight">11. International data transfers</h2>
      <p>
        Our service providers may store and process your data outside India (notably the United
        States, where Google and Cloudflare are headquartered). Where this happens, we rely on
        the standard contractual protections those providers offer, and the data remains subject
        to this Privacy Policy.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-2 tracking-tight">12. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or
        in applicable law. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page will always reflect the
        most recent revision. Material changes will be highlighted on this page for at least 30 days.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-2 tracking-tight">13. Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this Privacy Policy or our data practices?
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`} class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">{site.contactEmail}</a></li>
        <li>Phone: <a href={`tel:${site.phone}`} class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">{site.phoneDisplay}</a></li>
        <li>Web: <a href="/contact" class="text-indigo-600 hover:underline">{site.url}/contact</a></li>
      </ul>

      <p class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 text-sm text-slate-500">
        This policy is provided for general informational purposes and to set out our actual data
        practices. It is not legal advice. If you need a privacy policy tailored to a specific
        regulatory regime (DPDP Act, GDPR, CCPA, HIPAA, etc.), consult a qualified lawyer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
